      <title>三家实验室集体压低Token价格，两百万GPU订单同步落地</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260902/%E4%B8%89%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AE%A4%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E5%8E%8B%E4%BD%8EToken%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%E4%B8%A4%E7%99%BE%E4%B8%87GPU%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0/</link>
